    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<strong>Cairn Stone Balancing is a relaxing, meditative and satisfying game in which stones are stacked on top of one other to create land art. These balanced rock piles, or stone sculptures, are also known as stone cairns.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137570/extras/3024472ea1bb72c325019ada1142f2a0.avif?t=1674417617\" /></div><br><br>Simply use the mouse to rotate, maneuver and stack stones to make sculptures in a variety of inspiring landscapes. Enjoy the zen-like, relaxing experience of rock balancing. Meditate, relax, be creative, and have fun.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137570/extras/77e2da43da525cb895aedf2a5fdc5d3d.avif?t=1674417617\" /></div><br><br>Challenge yourself to complete tasks in challenge mode in order to unlock new levels and stones, or simply build whatever you like in creative mode.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137570/extras/c4d85cbee72034fcae0fe6681462fbbb.avif?t=1674417617\" /></div><br><br>The game features:<br><br>\u2022 Thousands of different rock shapes, sizes, patterns and types<br>\u2022 Beautiful locations: From beaches to mountains, waterfalls to deserts<br>\u2022 Real environmental ambient sounds<br>\u2022 Relaxing ASMR rock stacking sound effects<br>\u2022 Cutting edge, realistic graphics<br>\u2022 Ability to save and load sculptures<br>\u2022 Task challenges<br>\u2022 Easy to use mouse based controls",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Cairn Stone Balancing is a relaxing, meditative and satisfying game in which stones are stacked on top of one other to create land art. These balanced rock piles, or stone sculptures, are also known as stone cairns.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137570/extras/3024472ea1bb72c325019ada1142f2a0.avif?t=1674417617\" /></div><br><br>Simply use the mouse to rotate, maneuver and stack stones to make sculptures in a variety of inspiring landscapes. Enjoy the zen-like, relaxing experience of rock balancing. Meditate, relax, be creative, and have fun.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137570/extras/77e2da43da525cb895aedf2a5fdc5d3d.avif?t=1674417617\" /></div><br><br>Challenge yourself to complete tasks in challenge mode in order to unlock new levels and stones, or simply build whatever you like in creative mode.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137570/extras/c4d85cbee72034fcae0fe6681462fbbb.avif?t=1674417617\" /></div><br><br>The game features:<br><br>\u2022 Thousands of different rock shapes, sizes, patterns and types<br>\u2022 Beautiful locations: From beaches to mountains, waterfalls to deserts<br>\u2022 Real environmental ambient sounds<br>\u2022 Relaxing ASMR rock stacking sound effects<br>\u2022 Cutting edge, realistic graphics<br>\u2022 Ability to save and load sculptures<br>\u2022 Task challenges<br>\u2022 Easy to use mouse based controls",
